  "details": "**Description**\n\nWhen a mobile user interacts with a UI Canvas that has “Allow Focus View” enabled, clicking a teleport button does not teleport the player. The player remains in the same position until they manually exit Focus View.\n\n**Expected Behavior**\n\nClicking a teleport button should immediately teleport the player, regardless of Focus View state.\n\n**Suggested Fix**\n\nAllow world creators to temporarily disable or override Focus View when necessary.",
